OL,3,GNEWSANurse threatened to kill
OL,4,Acolleague, report finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home nurse accused of
OL,7,Fthreatening to "hunt down and kill" his
OL,8,Fcolleague and their family is set to be
OL,9,Fstruck off.
OL,11,FRupesh Patel was working as an agency
OL,12,Fnurse across Suffolk and Essex when he
OL,13,Fwas found to be under the influence on
OL,14,Fseveral occasions at work in late 2022.
OL,16,FHe was convicted of drink-driving in
OL,17,F2023, but has continued to deny
OL,18,Fdrinking at work, and denied using
OL,19,Fthreatening language towards his
OL,20,Fcolleague.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
